! josegude-phi-chord.scl
!
! The Field Trilogy phi-tuned augmented chord. E / G# / C at exact phi
! ratios; the other 9 chromatic notes at 12-TET. Octave = 2:1, so the
! sequence C1 -> C2 -> C3 -> C4 -> C5 behaves as expected (each C is
! exactly double the C below). Set base frequency to 266.67 Hz at MIDI
! note 60 (C4) to match the trilogy's anchor. With that setting:
!   E3  = 164.81 Hz
!   G#3 = 209.64 Hz
!   C4  = 266.67 Hz
!
Phi-tuned E/G#/C augmented chord (Field Trilogy)
